    "reviewTitle": "Weird, loose fit. Unusable",
    "reviewDescription": "While it has some very positive qualities, the fit of this eye mask is unfortunately very disappointing. First, the positives: The battery life is insanely long, the speakers are easily adjustable to be comfortable on your ears, the sound quality is decent (compared to my other relatively cheap sleeping headphones that I’d used before), and the material feels very silky soft. Now, the cons: The fit of this eye mask is bizarre and does not stay on at all. Instead of wrapping straight around your head like every other eye mask (including bluetooth headphone eye masks like this), this strap angles down weirdly, wraps around the base of the skull, and then slips off down the neck. Furthermore, the strap does not tighten enough to keep it secure on my head or face at all. After less than 4 nights, it’s completely unusable.",
